  "job_B3.2.40.6_20251003_114637": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00f0am gew\u00e6dum \u00fee \u00f0u hie hete. Hie w\u00e6ron ungemetf\u00e6ste eallum tidum & oferhidum to fulle & mines willan to georne. \u00deonne hie gehyrdon \u00feine bec r\u00e6dan & \u00fein godspel secgan & hira lif rihtan & him ecne weg cy\u00f0an, hy Ac \u00f0onne ic mine hearpan genam & mine strengas styrian ongan, hie \u00f0\u00e6t lustlice gehyrdon, & fram \u00fee & ic hie mine leahtras l\u00e6rde, & hie me hyrdon georne. & ic hie to \u00feeof\u00f0um tyhte & to geflite scyrpte & to inwitfullum ge\u00f0ancum, \u00fe\u00e6t ic wolde \u00fe\u00e6t hy Ac, hw\u00e6t, woldon hie in minon hordcofan, & \u00fein cynerice eal forgeaton. \u00c6t me hie leornodon scondword & lease br\u00e6gdas, & \u00feine so\u00f0f\u00e6stan lare hie forgeaton & \u00feinne dom ne Dem, la ealra gesceafta reccend & scippend & steorend, dem rihtne dom. Hw\u00e6t, \u00f0u \u00fee sylfne gemeddest for hyra ealra lufan & for urre l\u00e6\u00f0\u00f0o. \u00dein feorh for hyra in dea\u00f0 \u00feu gesealdest, & \u00feu \u00fee sylf on rode astige \u00f0\u00e6r \u00f0u \u00f0\u00e6t \u00fein halige blod on \u00dea hie to me cyrdon, n\u00e6fre ic him are ne gefremede, ne n\u00e6fre helpes geu\u00f0e; ac forl\u00e6t hie me in wite Hw\u00e6t, we nu gehyrdon secgan, men \u00f0a leofestan, hu bealdlice sprece\u00f0 \u00fe\u00e6t dioful to \u00feam h\u00e6lende, & He \u00feonne ofer eaxle besyh\u00f0, se so\u00f0f\u00e6sta dema & se rihtwisa, to \u00f0am forworhtum",
